{"ts":"2026-09-13T22:03:45Z","command":"/sdd","customer_prompt":"git status ederdin yarimciq is varsa tammala sonra commit et. sdd planinda olan caseler .claude qovluqunqa elav edilmeyib nezere alinsin. .sdd commandlarin icnde ferqli commandlar var ancaq .claude qovluqunda ve .kilo qovluqunda yoxdur...","ai_prompt":"Complete unfinished work from git status, then commit. Sync all .sdd/commands/ specs into .claude/commands/ and .kilo/command/ (3-way registry). Fix docker-compose to use locally built images (Dockerfile, no external registry images), mount all volumes under var/, gitignore data dirs. Enforce task-end commits, tmp/ discipline, prompt-root-only folders. Wire swagger UI mandatory in test/dev/local. Add DB column comments (why created, related-to, depends-on). Route duplication findings into the RF refactor chain. Map skills into .kilo. Add /sdd-clean and /sdd-compact delegating to the agent's native commands. Merge initial PR conflicts. Never commit AI-agent data. [R91-R105 encoding]"}
{"ts":"2026-09-13T22:03:46Z","command":"/sdd","customer_prompt":"Evvelki planlamaa elave et: AI imza xarakterli senedlerin git commit history-den butun branchlar uzre silinmesi. Local proqramlarla compile/lint edilmeyib docker uzerinden limitlenmis resursla edilmesi. Ilk security/dependabot alertleri fix olunmasi sonra mehsul tesiri. /sdd* promptlarinin customer/AI cifti kimi history-de saxlanilmasi. Docker limitleri mecburi. .sdd/projects/ qovluqlarinin safligi. SDDRA - SDD & Reasoning Architecture adlandirmasi, sddra.git (originally a pre-rename name) -> sddra.git (originally a pre-rename name). Refactor ve seliqe: lazimsiz fayllarin analizi, EN dilinde derin sistem senedleri, install yollari (avto/manual global/manual project), diaqramlar, opensource tovhleri haqqinda melumat, README-nin referens hub olmasi.","ai_prompt":"Extend the plan: purge AI-agent signature trailers from ALL git history on ALL branches (Co-Authored-By, Claude-Session, Generated-with). Hard rule: compile/lint/test never on local toolchains — Docker-limited-resources only ([R102]). Security-first ordering: dependabot alerts fixed before product impact, then merge ([R101]). Every /sdd* invocation appends {customer_prompt, ai_prompt} pair to prompts/history/prompt-pairs.jsonl ([R104]). Docker resource limits mandatory even when absent upstream. .sdd/projects/ purity: only real instances + template ([R105]). Rename SDDRA = SDD & Reasoning Architecture; repo pre-rename name -> sddra. Refactor analysis: unnecessary-files list, EN deep docs, install paths with pros/cons, Mermaid diagrams, contribution guide with worked examples, README as reference hub. [R103 provenance purge]"}
